The [[Oil Lamp]] is an item available in the shop for all classes. Every so often, it will grant a [[weapon]] touching its base +1 damage and +5% accuracy. It also grants 2 {{icon/heat}} at the start of battle, which increases all item speed by 4%. In general, this makes for a useful enhancement to an existing board, but especially so if the player has ways to spend or use {{icon/heat}}.

As the [[Oil Lamp]] is a [[Fire]] item, it can be used to light [[Lump of Coal]], but otherwise has no crafting options.

[[Buy the Holy Light]] specifically converts the [[Oil Lamp]] and [[Djinn Lamp]] into [[Holy]] items and speeds up the [[Holy]] items near it.
